nd a four piece ensuite. A second bedroom and a four piece bath sit near the entry, the laundry room doubles as storage, and the unit comes with its own storage space in the building. The balcony faces south off the living room, with room for the table and the barbecue. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$299,000"],["Type","Condo"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,227 sq ft"],["Year built","2010"],["Condo fee","$649 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Downtown"],["Town","St. Albert"],["Postal code","T8N1E3"],["MLS® number","E4511406"],["Listed","October 2, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer, Microwave Range Hood Combo, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Hot water radiator heat"],["Fireplace","Gas"],["Parking","Underground, Parkade"],["Condo fee includes","Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Heat, Water, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.38 m × 4.39 m (17'8\" × 14'5\")"],["Dining room","Main level","4.52 m × 2.84 m (14'10\" × 9'4\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.85 m × 2.84 m (15'11\" × 9'4\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","5.44 m × 3.15 m (17'10\" × 10'4\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","4.11 m × 2.92 m (13'6\" × 9'7\")"]],"courtesy":"Pete Muller, RE/MAX Elite and Erin Willman, RE/MAX Elite","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"st-albert","hood_slug":"downtown","area":""}